You wrap yourself in a cloak of sunlight that empowers your magic and protects you for 6 turns.

While the cloak is active, your spell casting speed is increased by [18%, 25%, 30%, 34%, 38% (TL1-5; SP 100)], your spell cooldowns are reduced by [34%, 39%, 41%, 42%, 44% (TL1-5; SP 100)], and you cannot take more than [89%, 77%, 69%, 63%, 59% (TL1-5)] of your maximum life from a single blow.

The effects will increase with your Spellpower.
